{"id":"662263","name":"芋仔焖鸡肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662263/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芋仔","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡腿洗净斩块。","img":"images/662263/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡腿加入玉米淀粉，蚝油，老抽。","img":"images/662263/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"抓拌均匀腌制半小时左右。","img":"images/662263/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"芋仔洗净放入电饭锅里。","img":"images/662263/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量清水煮至断生。","img":"images/662263/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮好的芋仔去皮改刀切小块。","img":"images/662263/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中热油放入鸡腿肉。","img":"images/662263/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煎炒至两面金黄。","img":"images/662263/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入芋仔翻炒。","img":"images/662263/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，盐调味。","img":"images/662263/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/662263/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大火煮开转小火焖至入味即可。","img":"images/662263/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662263/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662263/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}